# Options for uucpd.service and caller.service (UUCP over the HF modem).
# Read by systemd as an EnvironmentFile; uncomment to change a default.

# uucpd command line.  The default, set in the unit, is:
#   -a 127.0.0.1 -p 8300 -r vara -o shm -f 2750p -m
# -o shm keys the radio and reports the link through the radio controller's
# shared memory, which sbitx_controller, hermes-radio-daemon and
# ubitx_controller all provide.  Add -F for the pre-agreed UUCP startup
# (needs Rhizomatica uucp 1.07-37 or later, which gives uucico -Y).
#UUCPD_OPTS="-a 127.0.0.1 -p 8300 -r vara -o shm -f 2750p -m -F"

# Extra uucico options for the gateway's calls to the HF stations
# (caller.sh).  Set to "-Y" for the pre-agreed startup; every station it
# calls must then run uucpd -F.
#UUCICO_HF_OPTS="-Y"
